<title>CANADA: Ventra sees 1996 net earnings of C$3.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Ventra sees 1996 net earnings of C$3.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Ontario 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ventra Group Inc said on Thursday that it expects consolidated sales for the 1996 fiscal year ended September 30 will be C$320 million, with net income of about C$3.5 million or C$0.10 a share fully diluted.</p>
<p>Ventra said its earnings expectations were preliminary and subject to an audit currently underway.</p>
<p>It said the expectations reflect a provision for severance and related costs of the previously announced layoffs at Ventra unit, Doorhandle Systems.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
